- Sequelize setup with SQLite
- User model (name)
- Product model (title)
- Image model (url, imageableId, imageableType)
- Polymorphic associations (User.hasMany Images as profilePictures, Product.hasMany Images as productPhotos, Image.belongsTo User/Product)
